              "id": "fd07b6de-171f-4450-a141-9f09a55e7f2c",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>Inside Santa's Workshop: How Toy Inventors Develop, Sell, and Cash in on Their Ideas</strong></em> was written by Richard C. Levy &amp; Ronald O. Weingartner, Henry Holt &amp; Co in 1990."
