              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "6ae6589e-3fe3-4742-adaa-ed0d3115d4ee",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>Explains how </em><a href=\"#/toy\"><em>toys</em></a><em> are invented, designed, </em><a href=\"#/playtest\"><em>tested</em></a><em>, manufactured, marketed, and sold, recounts the origins of some classic toys and games, and offers advice for the amateur toy designer</em>"
